          "title": "Restricting App Access Immediately",
          "content": "To promptly block access to your Horizon App, you can enable the Kill Switch feature directly within the Horizon App by navigating to the Profile section, then selecting Security, and finally activating the Kill Switch. Alternatively, you can reach out to our dedicated customer support team via our hotline. After choosing your preferred language, simply press '{{faq_14914805_001}}' to report a suspected scam or fraud. You can also contact us through the Horizon App by navigating to the Profile section, selecting 'Contact us', choosing 'Contact Horizon for urgent matters', opting for either 'Talk to us via app' or 'Leave us a message via chat', and selecting 'Suspected Scam or Fraud'."
        },
        {
          "title": "Restoring Access on a New Device",
          "content": "You can restore access to your Horizon account by following these steps:\n{{faq_56fda9f9_001}}. Open the Horizon App and sign in.\n{{faq_56fda9f9_002}}. Choose the Singpass QR‑code option, scan it with the Singpass app, and verify your Singpass credentials.\n{{faq_56fda9f9_003}}. After verification, set a new six‑digit passcode for the Horizon App.\nOnce these actions are completed, the previous device will no longer be able to access your Horizon account."
        },
