        },
        {
          "title": "Protection Measures and Safeguards",
          "content": "At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your security and adhere to the guidelines outlined in Section {{faq_ed9b5ce2_001}} of the E-Payments User Protection Guidelines. As part of our commitment to the Shared Responsibility Framework, we have implemented several key measures to safeguard your accounts. These include a mandatory {{faq_ed9b5ce2_002}}-hour waiting period after activating your Horizon Key or logging in from a new device, during which certain high-risk activities are restricted; instant updates via push notifications and email for all outgoing payments; an Emergency Lockdown option accessible under Profile > Security; enhanced systems as of {{faq_ed9b5ce2_003}} June {{faq_ed9b5ce2_004}} to protect against phishing scams; and round-the-clock support available {{faq_ed9b5ce2_006}}/{{faq_ed9b5ce2_007}} via the hotline at +{{faq_ed9b5ce2_008}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_009}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_010}}."
